  "strings": [
    {
      "text": "Two high school counselors, one for public and independent schools and one for boarding — a structure the school added in 2023-24.",
      "of": "489258d4",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.headline"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Trinity frames the K–8 model as choosing a high school at the end of 8th grade rather than at the start of Kindergarten.",
      "of": "5e77e274",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.subhead"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "public + independent · boarding",
      "of": "d9161b1a",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.stats[0].denominator"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "high school counsellors, by published scope",
      "of": "1c352fe1",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.stats[0].caption"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Kindergarten through 8th grade",
      "of": "40a0591b",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.stats[1].denominator"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "years on one campus before the search begins",
      "of": "bf5b96af",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.stats[1].caption"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Throughout Middle School — knowing the schools",
      "of": "ca583a86",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].when"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Exposure",
      "of": "504443a0",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].kind"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "The counsellor for public and independent placement visits area schools and, in her words, gets “a feel for who might benefit from knowing this school,” then points families toward fits based on what they want: “Do they want big class sizes? Are sports important? Extracurricular?”",
      "of": "e135fec4",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[0].text"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Middle School — the boarding track, if a family wants it",
      "of": "eed87b96",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].when"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "A distinct route",
      "of": "f2125a71",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].kind"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Boarding placement is handled separately and by a different person. It is not a marginal path here: 12% of all graduates since 2004 went to boarding schools, and the destination list includes Deerfield, Lawrenceville, Mercersburg, Woodberry Forest, St. Paul’s and The Taft School.",
      "of": "05e13053",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[1].text"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Grade 8 — the decision",
      "of": "ef786a6f",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].when"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "The K–8 thesis",
      "of": "9c3a944a",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].kind"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "The school’s stated case is that nine years of one faculty knowing a child produces a better-informed choice: parents “feel more confident about finding the high school that’s best suited for their child at the end of 8th Grade rather than at the beginning of Kindergarten.”",
      "of": "70182269",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:placement.steps[2].text"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "Ninety-five named high schools across 23 graduating classes — and ten of them have their own dossier here.",
      "of": "99d8d661",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:destinations.headline"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the school’s own cumulative list for the Classes of 2004–2026, grouped by what each destination actually is. It is a list of names only: the school publishes no per-school counts and no per-year attribution, so no destination should be read as “N students went there”.",
      "of": "b9c27468",
      "at": [
        "trinity-episcopal:destinations.subhead"
      ],
      "t": ""
    },
